---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="How we'd work together" description="What happens when you hire me, and who you'd be working with.">
  <h1>How we'd work together</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>What happens first</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>You tell me the goal and who will use it.</li>
      <li>I tell you what's realistic, and what I'd leave out.</li>
      <li>You see working software early, not at the end.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Is this for you?</h2>
    <p><strong>Good fit:</strong> founders and small teams with an idea or a product and no developer of their own.</p>
    <p><strong>Not a fit:</strong> large agency-style projects with long contracts, many stakeholders and heavy process.</p>

    <h2>Who you'd be working with</h2>
    <p>I'm Taia Tiniyara, a software engineer based in Fiji. I build web apps, mobile apps and APIs, so you deal with one person, not three.</p>
    <p>I've been writing software since 2021. Before that I spent four years in graphic and web design, so I care how a thing looks as well as how it runs. Most of my work has been systems for Pacific island utilities: meter reading, billing and performance reporting.</p>

    <h2>Ready when you are</h2>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:mail@taiatiniyara.com">mail@taiatiniyara.com</a> with what you're building and when you need it.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
